 "type": "Software",
 "embodiment": "Multi-chip standalone",
 "description": "The STS Secure for Windows CE is a FIPS 140-2 Level 1 software module, comprised of the Security Manager Application Service (SMA) & AES NDIS Filter Driver, that runs on a general purpose computer. It is the basis for Inter-4's Tactinet networking technology. The primary purpose for the STS Secure software module is to provide data security for all network wireless/wired traffic. In addition to data in transit (DIT), file based encryption protects files tranferred to/from the platform via external USB drives, and sensitive data at rest (DAR) stored internally is also encrypted and zeroizable.",
